    {
      "subId": "4003401",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Bantan Sango Detective Agency",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400340102"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400340102": {
            "id": "400340102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Ah, you're here, as expected.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340103"
            ]
          },
          "400340103": {
            "id": "400340103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Ryuuji is currently investigating Yashiori Island to follow up on my hunches.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340104"
            ]
          },
          "400340104": {
            "id": "400340104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Let me mark the locations on your map. If you hurry, there will still be time to catch up with him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340105"
            ]
          },
          "400340105": {
            "id": "400340105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why are we in such hurry? Wasn't Ryuuji gonna meet us here and head out together with us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340106"
            ]
          },
          "400340106": {
            "id": "400340106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Because this investigation is fast approaching its end, of course. Hurry now. We're about to witness the truth coming to light.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340107"
            ]
          },
          "400340107": {
            "id": "400340107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Ooh, now that you say it like that, Paimon's getting all excited too! C'mon, {NICKNAME}, let's go!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4003402",
      "subQuestName": "Find Ryuuji and talk to him",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400340201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400340201": {
            "id": "400340201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ryuuji! We're here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340202"
            ]
          },
          "400340202": {
            "id": "400340202",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Ah, it's you two. Sango sent me here to do some preliminary investigations, saying that you would arrive shortly. Indeed you have.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340203"
            ]
          },
          "400340203": {
            "id": "400340203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, she told us you'd be here! How's everything going?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340204"
            ]
          },
          "400340204": {
            "id": "400340204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. There's nothing here but a bunch of cages for small animals. Where are the people at?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340205"
            ]
          },
          "400340205": {
            "id": "400340205",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "They just left. It's the Treasure Hoarders. Sango told me that they were planning to steal dogs and train them to become Treasure Hunting Hounds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340207",
              "400340209"
            ]
          },
          "400340207": {
            "id": "400340207",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Exactly. The thing about weasels is that they're mischievous creatures that are hard to teach. As such, their training was a failure. This time, they were planning to try this again, but with the more loyal \"dogs.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340210"
            ]
          },
          "400340210": {
            "id": "400340210",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Previously, we also handled quite a few commissions regarding the Treasure Hoarders. Now that I think about it, Sango was right about that, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340211"
            ]
          },
          "400340211": {
            "id": "400340211",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Just as people leave footprints behind, so too, do organizations leave unique traces. Although there were other lost and imprisoned animals that came up throughout this process, the signs eventually pointed back to the Treasure Hoarders all the same.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340212"
            ]
          },
          "400340212": {
            "id": "400340212",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "After consulting the previous methods we used to resolve these cases, I found my investigations leading me here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340213"
            ]
          },
          "400340213": {
            "id": "400340213",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "Still, to not leave a single guard behind... I must say that these perpetrators are just way too careless.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400340214"
            ]
          },
          "400340214": {
            "id": "400340214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#That's real complacent of them, alright! Still, Paimon's sure that even you're tired after so many days of fighting, aren't you, {NICKNAME}?"
          },
          "400340209": {
            "id": "400340209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
